Termix Plugin-File-Manager (https://github.com/Termix-SSH/Plugin-File-Manager)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The file manager user interface in src/frontend/vendor/file-manager/ is copied
from Plugin-File-Manager, Apache License 2.0. The files are kept identical to
the upstream commit recorded in vendor/UPSTREAM.lock.json. Our changes are
the numbered patches in vendor/patches/file-manager/ and the adapter modules in
src/frontend/vendor/file-manager/api/.

Other runtime dependencies (React components, CodeMirror, xterm.js, pdf.js,
JSZip, tar-stream and others) are listed in package.json and keep their own
licenses.
